Copyright 2026 Obscura SBX kit contributors

This project installs, but does not vendor, Obscura v0.2.6:
https://github.com/h4ckf0r0day/obscura (Apache-2.0).
Obscura archives include obscura and obscura-worker, built with upstream's
third-party dependencies, including V8 and rendering libraries. Distribution
must retain applicable upstream notices; inspect the release and source
licenses before publishing a new browser version.

Container bases and the kit frontend are separate upstream OCI artifacts.
Their licenses and SBOMs remain available from Docker/DHI. This repository's
Apache-2.0 license does not relicense those components.
